---
/* SKILLS SECTION — Infinite Stack Marquee
   Each technology renders as an element tile: symbol · name · category color.
   Tiles are CODE-DRAWN (SVG/CSS, no raster).

   Layout (mobile + desktop): three infinite-scrolling rows. Row 1 drifts right,
   row 2 left, row 3 right — each an endless loop (content duplicated so the seam
   never shows). Hover/tap reveals the category badge and fills the tile with
   "liquid" up to the proficiency level (chemistry read — the tile is a vessel),
   and pauses the row it sits in.

   The looping is pure CSS (@keyframes translateX 0 ↔ -50% over a doubled track).

   Category color tokens: --cat-* in tokens.css
*/

